{"id": "85814", "name": "נגזרת של מכפלת שני סכומים – פתיחת סוגריים ואז גזירה (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Expand the following expression and differentiate it with respect to {{CT:0}}:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Expanding, then linearity</b><br><p>In order to solve this problem we will have to use the linearity rules for differentiation.</p><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">Linearity: \\( \\frac{d}{dx}\\left(af(x)+bg(x)\\right)=af'(x)+bg'(x) \\)</div><p>Since</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}, \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left[ {{CT:1}}\\right] &= \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:2}}\\right) \\\\ &= \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:4}}\\right) + \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:5}}\\right) + \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:6}}\\right) + \\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:7}}\\right) \\\\ &= {{CT:8}}\\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:9}}\\right) + {{CT:10}}\\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:11}}\\right) + \\left({{CT:12}}\\right)\\frac{d}{d{{CT:3}}}\\left( {{CT:13}}\\right) + 0 \\\\ &= {{CT:8}}\\left[{{CT:14}}\\right] + ({{CT:10}}){{CT:15}} + \\left({{CT:12}}\\right)\\left[{{CT:16}}\\right] \\\\ &= {{CT:17}} + {{CT:18}} + {{CT:19}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(q,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(pp1+pp2,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You seem to have used the sum rule to differentiate a product. Use the product rule instead.<div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">The product rule: \\( \\frac{d}{dx}(uv)=u'v+uv' \\)</div></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(pp1,v)*diff(pp2,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">The derivative of a product is not the product of the derivative of each factor separately.   To differentiate a product you need to use the product rule.<div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">The product rule: \\( \\frac{d}{dx}(uv)=u'v+uv' \\)</div></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "ppp1", "ppp2", "ppp3", "ppp4", "pppp1", "pppp2", "pppp3", "pppp4", "q", "qq1", "qq2", "qq3", "qq4", "qqq1", "qqq2", "qqq3", "qqq4", "rdm1", "rdm2", "rdm3", "v"], "nvariants": 20}